// Greatsword moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes":
// wide, slow sweeps with hyperarmor, 2.6 m reach, Might. Frame numbers are tuning unless a
// spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are shared in common.ron; the critical
// pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
